# WP-8 part 1: the two mutations caught by GEN_FCOV_UT cases, with their ablation controls.
#
# PROVENANCE: same tree state as the coverage reds, whose unmutated control's sources sha256 equals the tree build
# 9ff74126059016cb (dv/auto_dv/work/tb-infra/wit/w26). Each catch runs with +gen_chk_all=0, so every Zone A
# check is OFF and the named unit-test cases are the only thing that can fail the run. Produced 2026-09-04T12:32:22Z.
#
# These two faults are invisible to any expectation file: a wrongly ROUTED event and a wrongly SIZED window produce a
# wrong value or a wrongly hit bin, and a manifest fails only an UNHIT declared bin. That is why the detector is a
# unit-test case reached in a real run through GEN_CMD_FCOV_SELFTEST rather than a coverage expectation.

