# The window pair is the sharper evidence: the mutation fails EXACTLY ONE of the four boundary cases, the one asserting
# that the last cycle of the window is inside, while the other three still pass.
#
# RESIDUAL, so the mutation table says what it does not cover: a mutation of the SPAN ARGUMENT at a call site is caught
# by nothing this build carries, and neither is a mutation of the multi-cycle history accumulation, which no unit-test
# case drives. The boundary cases test the arithmetic, not the constant handed to it nor the history feeding it.
